        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hosheya sugoocheanda Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba damaniyeenya bea sugoocheanduumeeda Ahasi was sugoocheanda Yuda, Hean ghoang'eat sugoocheanda Israeli mida Samariya Hosheya, was orjeeda Ela, ak ghwaak gweanyeew shageash. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin gea munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. Nea mawuurji sugoodiga Israeli ghayi mida madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwascheeng'u Shalmanesa was sugoocheanda Ashuru ghwahidu ng'ucheeda. Ak ghwanung' ghoah Hosheya siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, nea goodayiida gwaadi gilakweayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweecha goojeakta Hosheya buuneeda heeda So, sugoocheanda Misri nea abeeda gagasa weeta, nea abeeda ea mutgoodawi sugoocheanda Ashuru gwaadi gawuurji gideaba eawoojisu bea gilakweayda. Iiyiiy sugoocheanda Ashuru ghoang'waay ak gwarada amahit gwajaksa ghealooniga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibeedeayda Samariya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwaneaweesa sugoocheanda Ashuru ng'eanyiisean bea Israeli. Ak gawa ea ghwahita Samariya ak gwaneaweesa gweanyeew samwagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba shageash bea sugoocheanduumeeda Hosheya. Hean ghoang'waay sugoocheanda Ashuru Samariya, ak goobaleak fuga Israeli ea ghwahita Ashuru ak ghamwanya Hala ea Habori, neekeewa eenda Gosani, bea mujiineeda eemeeda Meedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji gwasa aba gideaba fuga Israeli nisin riing'eeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. Ghayi aruuna saawa ng'eanyiida Misri aba geatinda Farao was sugoocheanda Misri, nea ghwanung'wa heeda aseecheeka suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwasin searoojiga eemoojiga ghayi hoan NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeeda fuga Israeli. Ea searoojiga ghayi sin sugoodiga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu fuga Israeli gwasin ng'asheega miidoobiiweadi aba makcheameeda aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. Ak gwadeeksa geat heeda jea eebadiini ghadooweeda aba mujiinajeega nyaawa sean, ghang'eada madalooda furiischoodiga ea ghwahita mujiineeda sineaweesa ghamarda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geamiinda daranajeega ea aseecheeka siguura Asherimu, aba iheenga heayeeniga geawi. Ea gumsheaka geediga mideawa seenga nyawiiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geaghwarda geediga ng'andidi aba hoowa, aba heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda. Gawuurji gidaghayi sinda eemoojiga, ak ghahoan NG'UTAMIIDA aba madeanyaawa, ak gwasin ng'asheega munyas gideaba ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gagadiiyeesa sanaamu, dea ghayi heawa NG'UTAMIIDA, “Adoosinyi ng'asheanji.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara aba badaydeaba suh NG'UTAMIIDA gwareekusa fuga Israeli ea Yuda. Aba ghuuta gilinyoo ea sibaneeda gil, ea gilinyoo ea siida deaha ng'asheega gil nea gwayeesha, “Aduukuunana nea ghoanung'waadi naweadinga ng'asheegeagwa munyas, ak ghoang'waanyi diigheanyeekeasu as damanamughuush, ea huumeanyeekeasu aba giduurji deaweedajeega sean ghayi earukusi ghweanigeagwa, ak ghaanung' gweadu heedeang'wa fugeasu bea gadiyeeda was sibanga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mooleeysiiniit ghoahang'waay iheenga nyaawa, gawuurji iheenga ghweaniga nyaawa, nea mamwasa NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geaheawa huumeanyeakaaschi, ea neajeadaanyi ghayi sin sea ghweaniga nyaawa; nea maduupa eara, rukusiinda siitaw saawa. Ak geabwat sanaamajeega ng'uyeega, ak ghoah fuga ng'uyeega, nea ghwaat geeshta eemoojiga neaweesa saawa, ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba adagwasinda giduurji saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea geanung'waada digheanyeeka as damanamughuush bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa, ak gwasissa geat sanaamajeega was muhoow iyeenya, ea Ashera, nea geabwat miinga sean bea humng'eeda, nea geegadiyeesa Baali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geaghwarda orjooga nyaawa ea haweega nyaawa gawuurji haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda. Ak geabwar lagheanga nea geesin ng'ushoondooda, nea ghwashaayda sasanuuka nyaawa, gideaba gwasin ng'asheega munyas aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA bwak ea eanyareas niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyareas muuchi NG'UTAMIIDA aba badayda fuga Israeli, ak goobaleak goosheagiida headaanyi nea manda dea siipuut geaghus eemeeda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara fuga Yuda ea moang'waanya digheanyeeka atamanamughuush bea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. Ak ghwaat geeshta searoojiga fuga Israeli ghayi sin saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghwanung'wa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA jeacheenga sean bea fuga Israeli. Ak gwasawan nea ghwayiin geatinga fuga jea ghwanung' ghoah saawa rabadanga. Ea ghwahita damanda jea gwajakteawa ghoang'aamwa madeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gooheeli ea goosheagiit fuga Israeli ea gheeh Dawdi. Ak geanung' ghoah Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati sugoocheanda. Nea Yeroboamu ea mwanung' ghwaat fuga Israeli geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghwanung' gwasin riing'eeda haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Israeli ghwaat geeshta riing'eega sean sin Yeroboamu, mii ghoang'aamwa geat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'aamwa NG'UTAMIIDA fuga Israeli madeadaanyi. Gawuurji gidanyaashta aba ghuuta fugaaschi sean bea gadiyeeda was sibanga. Iidu fuga Israeli geepaleak eang'aamwa ng'eanyiida nyaawa, ak gaweay ng'eanyiida Ashuru ea ghoah ghamneawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Ashuru ghamway ng'eanyiida Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gweadu sugoocheanda Ashuru buuneeda leabu Babeli ea Guta, ea Afa, ea Hamati, ea Sefarfaimu. Ak ghwanung' goobiida mujiineeda Samariya, hoorgeeda fuga Israeli ak goombal Samariya nea goobiida mujiinajeagaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damandida duu ghoang'eat giibindeaba hooweani, eamwaada geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA. Hean ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA gawa ng'adiida bugusta nyaawa ak ghabwar mwaatkwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda Ashuru, “Eemeedida iibaleagu ak gimwanyi mujiinajeega Samariya, mwanala deaweedeeda aseeta ng'eanyiida, hean ea niibita ng'adiida bugusta nyaawa, ak ghabwar saawa. Aba gideaba mwanala deaweedeeda ASEETA ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat sugoocheanda Ashuru ak ghoadayda diigheanda nea gwayeesha, “Oocheakta ashoohoocheanjagi aba jeeda geaghayi oopaleakni hoowa, ak gawa goobiida hoowa nea ghoanaal deaweedeeda aseeta ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa akaleala aba jeeda ashoohoodiga ghayi siipaleakna Samariya goobiida Beteli, ak ghoanaal gida jea eayaata geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gilinyoo ea eemoojiga gil gwasissa geat sanaamu. Ak geayiin heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda ghayi sin fuga Samariya, nea gaba eemeeni abiida mujiineadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Babeli gwasin Sukot-benoti ghoah aseeta jea eebada. Fuga Guta gwasin Nergali, nea fuga Hamati gwasin Ashima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga Ifa gwasin Nibhasi ea Dartaki, nea fuga Sefarfi ghaghwarda diibiga nyaawa aba beasta Adrameleki ea Anameleki was aseecheeka Sefarfaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu eara ada ghabwat NG'UTAMIIDA, ak mwaatkwa aba jeenyaawa geanung' ghoah ashoohoodiga heeda sibadiini ghadooweeda, nea geesissa lukghumeeda aba gheeda sibadiini ghadooweeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geabwat NG'UTAMIIDA nea eara ada geegadiyeesa aseecheeka nyaawa. Gawuurji searoojiga eemoojiga ghayi siipaleakna bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara ghamneawa searoojiga nyaawa ea gudea gea ghayi bea madeeda gil. Nea meawala eara NG'UTAMIIDA, nea meayaada geeshta huumeanyeeka ghana deaweedajeega ghana digheanyeeka atamanamughuush, ghayi rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA diibiga Yakobo ghayi sing'assa gheawunga siyi Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NG'UTAMIIDA gwasin neajeeda sea saawa, ak gwarukusa saawa nea gwayeesha, “Adoobadayi aseecheew suuk nea adootkuysi saawa, nea adoogadiyeesi saawa nea adoatawji lukghumeeda saawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaghus aghadoawana NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi aruunaneegwa ng'eanyiida Misri aba uurda haw, ea geatinda mideawa uurda. Niny dea jea atkuysiina gil, nea ghoatawji lukghumeeda niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak huumeanyeeka ea deaweedajeega ea digheanyeeka atamanamughuush, ghayi eang'oorneegwa gajoang'waanya muuchi galeagasean. Nea adoabwachi aseecheew suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea adagwarooseegwa neajeeda ghayi easinyi sea agooga, nea adoabwachi aseecheew suuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geaghus aghadoawana NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA dea jea aghadoawana gil, ak gayghoaghuuheagwa aba geatinda weajoodigeagwa sean.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fiisu ea mooleeysiiniit ng'asheesu, geayaat geeshta searoojiga nyaawa ghayi bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 17:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean eemeeni ghabwat NG'UTAMIIDA, nea eara ada gagadiiyeesa sanaamu. Diibiga nyaawa, ak eara diibiga nyaawa gwasinda gidasinda ghweaniga nyaawa, ak eara saawa gwasindunu ea ghoah ghamneawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.17.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.17.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
